  "guideTitle": "GUIDELINES",
  "guideWelcome": "Welcome to RWANDA TRAFFIC RULE",
  "guideAboutTitle": "1. App description",
  "guideAboutBody": "This app called ``RWANDA TRAFFIC RULE`` is an app that teaches traffic rules, consisting of questions asked in the provisional exam (learner permit)",
  "guideUseTitle": "2. HOW THE APP WORKS",
  "guideUseBody": "1. To use this app you must first sign up when you first download it where you are asked to write your full name, your phone number; confirm and sign up approved\n\n2. When you already signed up you do not need to sign up again but instead sign up \\\"SIGN IN\\\" then you can enter your phone number then sign up \\\"APPROVED\\\" then you will be taken to dashboard where you will see items in the app.\n\n3. To start learning, sign up \\\"PRACTICE\\\" when you open it consists of 21 exams each consisting of 20 questions, but the first exam is free (free) the rest require payment.\n\n4. When you are practicing in this app, the row you make changes from green to red and when you mark it changes from green to red because practice always shows the correct answer so you can try to capture it (remember it) then sign up written \\\"NEXT\\\" go to the next question when you reach the end sign up written \\\"SUBMIT EXAM\\\" then you will see the score then choose another exam to learn",
  "guideExamTitle": "3. HOW YOU SEE QUESTIONS ON THE PROVISOIRE EXAM NYIRIZINA",
  "guideExamBody": "A. Go to the provisoireform on the machine First they will assess (evaluate) that you do not have disability, vision, hearing, reading and writing skills, proper identification number (identification) and that day's code, many others,... example fingerprint, on the thumb left index,...\n\nB. You will see these questions in this app as they are in the exam no questions they will ask you in the provisoire exam that are not in this app, If you choose an answer you will continue then the next question then you sign up \\\"NEXT\\\" continue with other questions when you finish you sign up \\\"SUBMIT EXAM\\\" then you will know the score so choose another exam to learn",
  "guidePaymentTitle": "4. PAY TO UNLOCK ALL EXAMS",
  "guidePaymentBody": "1. As I explained earlier the first exam is free the other 20 require payment 1500Rwf to learn one month, 3000Rwf to learn three months or 5000 Rwf to learn six months on 0788659575/ 0728877442 or on MOMO PAY: 329494 merchant Alexis.\n\nTo pay using any number you choose is valid not mandatory to mention but if you use another number when you finish paying you will receive a message\n\nA. Pay using MTN:\na. *182*1*1*0788659575*1500#\nb. *182*8*1*329494*1500#\n\nB. Pay using Tigo or Airtel\na. *500*1*1*0728877442*1500#\nb. *182*8*1*88329494*1500#\nMerchant Alexis\n\n2. When you finish paying go check if you have connection (internet) wait two minutes then sign in before writing language on the screen then open practice you will see them unlocked all of them.\n\n4. OTHER MEANINGS THAT CAUSED YOU TO RECEIVE A MESSAGE:",
